###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{opened.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{instructor.response.body.token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/open?code={{opened.response.body.code}}
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/open?code={{opened.response.body.code}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{opened.response.body.id}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{instructor.response.body.token}}

